<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/2/eng@/~cl_2> <https://schema.org/text> "The Diplomatic Privileges (Vienna Convention) Act 1966 [Act 24/1996], which in this Act is referred to as the \"principal Act\", is amended by substituting for the words \"the Federation\" wherever they appear the word \"Malaysia\". Amendment of section 3"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/2/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/2/eng@/~cl_3> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/2/eng@> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/2/eng@> .
