<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/2/eng@/~cl_3> <https://schema.org/text> "Subsection 3(2) of the principal Act is amended by deleting the definition of \"head of mission\". Bill New sections 8 and 9"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/2/eng@> .
