<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/2/eng@/~cl_4__para_a__subpara_ii> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/2/eng@/~cl_4__para_a> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1999/2/eng@> .
